# Printable keybind sheets built by tools/keybind_mine.py from one character's
# SavedVariables. Personal output, named after the character, regenerated on demand —
# and MY_KEYBINDS.html is the old fixed name from before the per-character rename.
tools/KEYBINDS_*.html
tools/MY_KEYBINDS.html

# Same idea for tools/profession_plan.py: the sheet lists Rob's own characters and
# realms, so the generator is version-controlled and its output never is.
tools/PROFESSIONS_PLAN.html

# tools/check_drift.py --seed pakt de locale-bestanden van een oude tag hierheen uit
# om ze door de echte loader te halen. Wegwerp, en volledig af te leiden uit git.
tools/.baseline-*/
